acceptance_criteria: Maintainer explicitly approves the destructive published-history rewrite plan; every branch and tag is rewritten to public-safe identities without changing tree content; force-updated refs and downstream clone migration are coordinated; post-rewrite author committer tagger and content scans pass across every ref; npm and GitHub release provenance remains documented; the package release gate fails closed until completion
risk: critical
severity: critical
